[49m[38;5;10m+     1[0m:[38;5;10m[49m # CONFIGS.md — Phase B configuration-surface table
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Mechanical derivation of the axes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     4[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     5[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The C library is one straight-line translation unit with no conditionals
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     6[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (see `ERRORS.md` for the grep proving 0 `if`/`switch`/`#ifdef`). The axes it
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m actually distinguishes therefore come from its **state** and its **entry
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m points**, not from option flags:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 1 — entry point.** Two exported symbols (`SYMBOLS.md`):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `run(int)` — the LOW-LEVEL entry point. Not declared in `driver.h`, but
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   non-`static`, hence part of the ABI. Performs one 4-print pass.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `driver(int)` — the convenience wrapper: `run(x); run(x);`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Both must be driven directly; `driver` alone would never show a single-pass
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m state transition, and `run` alone would never show the compounded double pass.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 2 — persistent mutable global state.** `static house_t the_house` is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m file-scope, mutated in place, and **never reset**. Each call permanently
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m advances it, so the output of call *N* depends on all of calls *1..N−1*:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `floors` : starts `2`, `+1` per `run` (`add_floor_to_the_house`)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `bathrooms` : starts `2.5`, `+= 1.0` per `run` (direct write in `run`)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `bedrooms` : starts `5`, `+= extra_bedrooms` per `run` (`add_bedrooms`)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m This makes *call-sequence length* and *call-sequence composition* real
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m configuration axes. Every row below is therefore executed in a **freshly
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `exec`'d process per library** so the starting state is pristine and the C and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Rust runs are directly comparable.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 3 — argument value shape** (the sole parameter is a bare `int`):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m zero / one / minus-one / small / large / `INT_MAX` / `INT_MIN` / the exact
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m overflow boundary of `5 + extra_bedrooms` / uniformly random over all 2^32.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 4 — printed-value shape**, i.e. what `printf("%d ... %d ... %.1f")` is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m handed: positive, negative (leading `-`), the widest `%d` (`-2147483648`),
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 1-to-4-digit `floors`, and `%.1f` of a `double` that is always exactly
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `2.5 + k` (so the fraction digit is exact and no rounding mode is involved) at
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m small and large magnitude.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 5 — ABI-level call shape**: argument passed as a proper 32-bit `int`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m vs. a 64-bit value whose high half is non-zero (register-truncation behaviour).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m There are **no** runtime options, modes, flags, byte-order choices, element
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m types, or formats: the public surface is `void run(int)` / `void driver(int)`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Stating otherwise would be inventing configuration the C does not have.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Table
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Each row is run against BOTH `.so`s through `libloading` in separate processes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    48[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and stdout is compared byte-for-byte. "randomized" = SplitMix64 with a fixed
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    49[0m:[38;5;10m[49m seed (`0x5eed_1234_5678_9abc`), reproducible.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |---|----------------|-------------------------------------------|-----|
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 1 | `run` | fresh state, `extra_bedrooms = 0` | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 2 | `run` | fresh state, `extra_bedrooms = 1` | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 3 | `run` | fresh state, `extra_bedrooms = -1` | [x] |
