[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 7 | `run` | fresh state, `extra_bedrooms = -5` (bedrooms lands exactly on `0`) and `-6` (lands on `-1`) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 8 | `run` | fresh state, 64 randomized full-range `i32` values, one fresh process per value | [x] |
